      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تلقّحت</span></b>  <i>She</i> (a camel) <i>pretended that she
had conceived,</i> or <i>become pregnant,</i> (<i>by raising
her tail, in order that the stallion might not
approach her,</i> TA,) <i>when this was not really the
case.</i> (Fr, S, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See 1.

